WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:03.919
The One Piece Manga Just Revealed something
about the world of One Piece and its history

00:00:03.919 --> 00:00:07.380
that will change how we see the story forever.

00:00:07.380 --> 00:00:12.040
Because as it turns out, Egghead island the
Island with the most insane technology on

00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:16.430
the entire planet, is not the island of the
future after all.

00:00:16.430 --> 00:00:21.620
Instead, Vegapunk explains that his research
lab is actually a place of the past.

00:00:21.620 --> 00:00:26.349
His technology pales in comparison to the
technically advancements made by the legendary

00:00:26.349 --> 00:00:30.070
ancient kingdom, that was destroyed during
the void century.

00:00:30.070 --> 00:00:36.140
And we see Luffy discovering what seems to
be a gigantic ancient robot outside the lab.

00:00:36.140 --> 00:00:41.200
And there are 5 incredibly important things
that we can take away from this.

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:44.570
Like the fact that we now know for certain
that One Piece is a story taking place in

00:00:44.570 --> 00:00:46.500
a post-apocalyptical world.

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:48.980
Which is absolutely crazy.

00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:51.840
But where did Oda get the idea for this?

00:00:51.840 --> 00:00:57.160
This reveal felt a lot like the one in Attack
on Titan, where you get fed one narrow perspective

00:00:57.160 --> 00:01:02.710
on what the world is like, until you find
out nothing is what it seems.

00:01:02.710 --> 00:01:06.080
That’s the exact same feeling here.

00:01:06.080 --> 00:01:10.790
Turns out the world of one piece, as we know
it, is the cataclysmic aftermath of an era

00:01:10.790 --> 00:01:13.430
of greatness before.

00:01:13.430 --> 00:01:16.729
The first thing that came to my mind here
is the wheel of time.

00:01:16.729 --> 00:01:20.020
In case you are not familiar with the story,
it’s a fantasy novel that takes place in

00:01:20.020 --> 00:01:26.010
a medieval, lord of the rings-like world,
in the 3rd age after the breaking of the world.

00:01:26.010 --> 00:01:29.110
Even though it is not a major plot point,
throughout the story the author feeds the

00:01:29.110 --> 00:01:34.100
reader hints, that the world before this breaking
was actually our own reality.

00:01:34.100 --> 00:01:40.190
That humanity became incredibly advanced in
the future and ultimately destroyed itself.

00:01:40.190 --> 00:01:44.770
Leading to a complete setback and a world
that feels like fantasy.

00:01:44.770 --> 00:01:48.939
That’s exactly the vibes i’m getting from
all this.

00:01:48.939 --> 00:01:53.890
i can’t even begin to tell you how great
a piece of writing this is.

00:01:53.890 --> 00:01:57.910
It makes the lore and story of one piece even
better than it already was.

00:01:57.910 --> 00:02:02.950
The love Oda has for aliens and sci fi stories
like star wars are also gotten really apparent

00:02:02.950 --> 00:02:04.710
in recent events.

00:02:04.710 --> 00:02:11.290
And the giant mossy robot from a lost civilization
has pretty strong ‘castle in the sky vibes’

00:02:11.290 --> 00:02:16.459
a gihbli movie that seems to have a number
of connections with one piece.

00:02:16.459 --> 00:02:17.709
Go watch it if you haven’t.

00:02:17.709 --> 00:02:18.709
It’s fantastic.

00:02:18.709 --> 00:02:22.000
But it’s not only fiction that Oda was inspired
by.

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:28.370
Because there are multiple theories out there,
that our own world experienced such a set-back

00:02:28.370 --> 00:02:29.490
as well.

00:02:29.490 --> 00:02:34.310
People like Graham Hancock or Randal Carlson
argue that the last ice age started and ended

00:02:34.310 --> 00:02:40.400
with a cataclysmic catastrophe that might
have wiped an already advanced ancient civilsation

00:02:40.400 --> 00:02:46.640
from the face of the planet, roughly 12.000
years ago, lost as the sea levels rose over

00:02:46.640 --> 00:02:49.170
80 meters in the aftermath.

00:02:49.170 --> 00:02:53.450
It was this ancient civilization that built
the pyramids all around the world and mapped

00:02:53.450 --> 00:02:54.700
the entire planet.

00:02:54.700 --> 00:03:01.430
Now, I’m neither an archeologist nor a geologist,
so I can’t evaluate how accurate this is,

00:03:01.430 --> 00:03:04.500
though there seems to be increasing evidence
for it.

00:03:04.500 --> 00:03:08.100
In any case, it doesn’t matter for us here.

00:03:08.100 --> 00:03:13.090
It’s an incredibly fun and interesting topic
to go down the rabbit hole for and due to

00:03:13.090 --> 00:03:18.090
all the similarities these theories have with
Oda’s writing, I am 99% convinced that he

00:03:18.090 --> 00:03:20.700
took inspiration from this idea.

00:03:20.700 --> 00:03:24.880
Which brings be to the second point on my
list: What does this major reveal mean for

00:03:24.880 --> 00:03:28.340
the one piece world and the context of the
story?

00:03:28.340 --> 00:03:34.220
There used to be modern day technology on
the planet, including space travel and advanced

00:03:34.220 --> 00:03:35.220
computing.

00:03:35.220 --> 00:03:40.129
But at some point this advanced civilization
got defeated by the 20 kingdoms that later

00:03:40.129 --> 00:03:44.290
became the world government that is ruling
the world today.

00:03:44.290 --> 00:03:45.290
After this war.

00:03:45.290 --> 00:03:50.319
a major technological setback happened, throwing
the world back into the age of guns and swords

00:03:50.319 --> 00:03:51.319
and sea-faring.

00:03:51.319 --> 00:03:57.170
It also explains why the world government
was so keen on wiping any trace of this kingdom

00:03:57.170 --> 00:04:02.079
from the history books: If someone were to
find out the truth about their advanced civilization,

00:04:02.079 --> 00:04:07.739
they would try and find and revive its technology
and use it against them.

00:04:07.739 --> 00:04:13.700
Imu and the government are purposefully withholding
this knowledge and banning any research on

00:04:13.700 --> 00:04:19.120
it, to keep their subjects unaware and incapable
of standing up against their tyrannical rule.

00:04:19.120 --> 00:04:23.550
Now you might be wondering why that is such
a big deal.

00:04:23.550 --> 00:04:28.230
After all there were many hints already in
the story that the ancient kingdom was quite

00:04:28.230 --> 00:04:29.230
powerful.

00:04:29.230 --> 00:04:30.880
So what has changed?

00:04:30.880 --> 00:04:36.750
It’s the fact that what Luffy finds is a
giant functioning titanic robot.

00:04:36.750 --> 00:04:41.520
We kind of assumed that much in the one piece
world is basically based on the stories own

00:04:41.520 --> 00:04:44.220
magic system.

00:04:44.220 --> 00:04:48.530
Devil fruits have a literal devil in them,
the ancient weapons are just unique abilities

00:04:48.530 --> 00:04:54.460
certain people have and the ancient kingdom
built big cities, like wano and shandora and

00:04:54.460 --> 00:04:59.110
were a place where everyone could live together
in harmony.

00:04:59.110 --> 00:05:03.820
Technology wise maybe on the level of Ancient
Greece or something like that if you like.

00:05:03.820 --> 00:05:09.090
But with the reveal that all of the fantastic
technology that Oda has shown us in vegapunks

00:05:09.090 --> 00:05:14.229
lab so far, that all of that is not even on
the same level as the ancient kingdom used

00:05:14.229 --> 00:05:20.290
to be, it tells us, that we are talking star
wars civilization level instead of ancient

00:05:20.290 --> 00:05:21.400
rome.

00:05:21.400 --> 00:05:24.770
That’s absolutely insane.

00:05:24.770 --> 00:05:30.530
It means that the entire power system in One
PIece might very well be science.

00:05:30.530 --> 00:05:35.220
After all science that is advanced enough
does look like magic if you’re unfamiliar

00:05:35.220 --> 00:05:36.220
with it.

00:05:36.220 --> 00:05:40.910
It means that devil fruits could be a technology
and not some sort of power system.

00:05:40.910 --> 00:05:46.819
it also means, that the ancient weapons, to
me at least, suddenly become a much more terrifying

00:05:46.819 --> 00:05:49.199
and graspable threat as well.

00:05:49.199 --> 00:05:52.440
Think about something like the death star.

00:05:52.440 --> 00:05:56.699
I explained how much Oda loves Star wars in
the last chapter review, where he introduced

00:05:56.699 --> 00:05:59.039
light saber technology.

00:05:59.039 --> 00:06:05.270
Pluton being buried in the volcano under wano
could be some apocalyptic giant machine with

00:06:05.270 --> 00:06:07.130
unfathomable powers.

00:06:07.130 --> 00:06:12.419
i think the idea that it’s futuristic war
tech, makes it so much more fascinating and

00:06:12.419 --> 00:06:13.419
terrifying.

00:06:13.419 --> 00:06:17.490
No wonder than maybe, that Roger was laughing
when he learned the true history.

00:06:17.490 --> 00:06:23.509
About a time when you could fly to the moon,
heal all diseases and change the face of the

00:06:23.509 --> 00:06:25.099
planet itself.

00:06:25.099 --> 00:06:30.150
Joy boy most likely explained how all that
knowledge and technology would one day come

00:06:30.150 --> 00:06:32.919
back, once the right conditions are met.

00:06:32.919 --> 00:06:37.699
no wonder that Roger wished he was born in
the same era as Joy Boy.

00:06:37.699 --> 00:06:41.069
And no wonder he and his crew were too early.

00:06:41.069 --> 00:06:46.069
The knowledge and skills of this advanced
civilization were lost and would only return

00:06:46.069 --> 00:06:48.020
at a certain point in the future.

00:06:48.020 --> 00:06:55.180
It of course also explains why the world government
and Imu have technology no one else has.

00:06:55.180 --> 00:06:59.430
Like the ability to eradicate an entire island.

00:06:59.430 --> 00:07:06.050
They got their hands on the pieces of technology
that they wanted to secure their rule.

00:07:06.050 --> 00:07:12.599
Which begs the third question: How in the
world did a kingdom with this level of knowledge

00:07:12.599 --> 00:07:14.660
crumble in the first place?

00:07:14.660 --> 00:07:19.080
The only thing we know for a fact about the
end of the void century, is that 20 countries

00:07:19.080 --> 00:07:22.009
gathered together to defeat the ancient kingdom.

00:07:22.009 --> 00:07:25.789
These countries would later on become the
celestial dragons, who are secretly being

00:07:25.789 --> 00:07:28.039
ruled by the mysterious Imu.

00:07:28.039 --> 00:07:33.699
But if Joy Boy and co were as powerful as
they seemed to have been, how did they lose?

00:07:33.699 --> 00:07:40.190
One explanation is, that just like any other
empire in history, no matter how long it lasts,

00:07:40.190 --> 00:07:45.599
at some point it starts falling apart from
inside, like Numenor in Lord of the rings.

00:07:45.599 --> 00:07:50.530
A country that’s so wealthy and comfortable
in their position, that they start having

00:07:50.530 --> 00:07:54.699
infighting and corruption gnawing away at
its former glory.

00:07:54.699 --> 00:08:01.310
Maybe Imu and the 20 kings were actually allied
with or part of the ancient kingdom and backstabbed

00:08:01.310 --> 00:08:02.560
Joy Boy.

00:08:02.560 --> 00:08:08.360
Another option, is that the kingdom wasn’t
the only country with advanced technology.

00:08:08.360 --> 00:08:12.270
Maybe the war was a conflict like we know
if from star wars, where boths sides have

00:08:12.270 --> 00:08:14.620
access to terrible and advanced weapons.

00:08:14.620 --> 00:08:19.610
Or, there is the wheel of time option, where
the civilsation becomes so advanced that they

00:08:19.610 --> 00:08:22.360
discover something they shouldn’t have.

00:08:22.360 --> 00:08:28.310
An external force, even greater than them,
Maybe the devil or devil fruit technology

00:08:28.310 --> 00:08:32.750
was the thing that allowed the government
to wage war on the kingdom.

00:08:32.750 --> 00:08:35.669
A new power ot match joy boy’s.

00:08:35.669 --> 00:08:39.339
This would be a great explanation for Imu,
someone who offered the celestial dragons

00:08:39.339 --> 00:08:44.500
his help, while secretly taking the throne
for himself, ruling from the shadows, where

00:08:44.500 --> 00:08:49.810
he is able to still rely on his own ancient
technology, like the one that destroyed God

00:08:49.810 --> 00:08:51.220
Valley and Lulusia.

00:08:51.220 --> 00:08:55.120
Which means that for item 4 on our list, we
have to talk about all the things in the one

00:08:55.120 --> 00:09:00.339
piece world that have hinted at technology
capable of shaping an entire planet.

00:09:00.339 --> 00:09:03.660
Like the actual one piece planet itself.

00:09:03.660 --> 00:09:07.790
Anyone who has seen the layout of the globe
knows, that the world of one piece feels incredibly

00:09:07.790 --> 00:09:08.850
artificial.

00:09:08.850 --> 00:09:13.680
the Grandline and Red line meet at a perfect
90 degree angle, and thus split the world

00:09:13.680 --> 00:09:18.899
of one piece into 4 equally sized regions,
overlooked by the ruling celestial dragons

00:09:18.899 --> 00:09:22.100
on top of the only continent in existence.

00:09:22.100 --> 00:09:27.360
The red line is impossible to cross, since
flying technology is actively kept from emerging,

00:09:27.360 --> 00:09:30.960
while the grand line, with its dangerious
and unpredictable weather and currents and

00:09:30.960 --> 00:09:35.920
the windless calm belt around it guarded by
the sea kings, make it impossible to cross

00:09:35.920 --> 00:09:36.920
by ship.

00:09:36.920 --> 00:09:41.839
The rest of the world seems to be flooded,
so that the only inhabitable place are islands.

00:09:41.839 --> 00:09:46.670
This results in a population that can’t
form larger groups or travel and learn about

00:09:46.670 --> 00:09:47.670
the world.

00:09:47.670 --> 00:09:52.320
Which of course is designed to keep people
from rising up against the government or learn

00:09:52.320 --> 00:09:55.660
about things the government doesn’t want
them to learn about.

00:09:55.660 --> 00:10:01.040
All the weird anomalies, like the existence
of sky islands or the giant hole under enies

00:10:01.040 --> 00:10:02.040
lobby.

00:10:02.040 --> 00:10:05.779
We originally thought that it might have been
devil fruits who shaped the world in this

00:10:05.779 --> 00:10:06.779
way.

00:10:06.779 --> 00:10:11.360
But now that we know just how advanced the
ancient kingdom really was, it seems much

00:10:11.360 --> 00:10:17.459
more likely that actual technology or weapons
were used to terraform the planet into a place

00:10:17.459 --> 00:10:21.320
that is easy to rule and control.

00:10:21.320 --> 00:10:23.260
Think of Enel and his findings on the moon.

00:10:23.260 --> 00:10:27.570
The fact that he found the plans for an actual
spaceship in Shandora and that he encountered

00:10:27.570 --> 00:10:30.420
space pirates were always odd.

00:10:30.420 --> 00:10:35.200
But now all these things are suddenly closely
tied to the void century.

00:10:35.200 --> 00:10:39.720
There is technology and an army of robots
on the moon powered by electricity.

00:10:39.720 --> 00:10:44.769
We have the giant arc noah, a ship big enough
to carry an entire civilization, waiting to

00:10:44.769 --> 00:10:46.170
be used again.

00:10:46.170 --> 00:10:52.410
And as we know, the technology in one piece
is all over the place: You have space ships

00:10:52.410 --> 00:10:57.399
and lazer technology, while most people seem
to be stuck in the 17 hundreds, fighting with

00:10:57.399 --> 00:10:59.390
swords and canons.

00:10:59.390 --> 00:11:03.639
Modern steel warships, while most people sail
on wooden ones.

00:11:03.639 --> 00:11:07.450
Video live streaming, while the rest of the
world is stuck with paper.

00:11:07.450 --> 00:11:19.160
And curiously enough, all this advanced technology
seems to be Monopolized by one faction.

00:11:19.160 --> 00:11:23.550
So for number 5 on the list, we have to ask
ourselves: What does this reveal mean for

00:11:23.550 --> 00:11:26.220
Vegapunk and the government?

00:11:26.220 --> 00:11:31.260
One thing that the story so far, and the egghead
island arc in particular has made clear, is

00:11:31.260 --> 00:11:35.800
that Dr. Vegapunk doesn’t think very highly
of himself.

00:11:35.800 --> 00:11:40.389
He describes momo’s devil fruit as a failure
and is clearly not very impressed with his

00:11:40.389 --> 00:11:42.950
own work, calling it a place of the past.

00:11:42.950 --> 00:11:48.670
Now I don’t think anyone who can build the
things he has built can be called anything,

00:11:48.670 --> 00:11:53.480
but a genius, but it seems llke Vegapunk has
been reverse engineering a lot of the major

00:11:53.480 --> 00:12:00.399
inventions he is credited with from technology
from the void century, something that seems

00:12:00.399 --> 00:12:01.550
to bother him.

00:12:01.550 --> 00:12:08.279
He seems disappointed that he can’t do what
the people 800 years ago were capable off.

00:12:08.279 --> 00:12:14.740
Even though Momo’s fruit is a perfect copy
of Kaido’s, it’s just that, a copy.

00:12:14.740 --> 00:12:17.029
Not an actual new devil fruit.

00:12:17.029 --> 00:12:22.160
Based on the winged robots seen on the moon
by enel, it seems like the seraphim and pacifista

00:12:22.160 --> 00:12:24.709
were also based on ancient technology.

00:12:24.709 --> 00:12:29.740
They are based on research he conducted on
Kuma and King, who both seem to be lunarians,

00:12:29.740 --> 00:12:34.980
who were known as the gods who lived on the
red line, possibly the original people of

00:12:34.980 --> 00:12:36.290
the ancient kingdom.

00:12:36.290 --> 00:12:41.130
The giant robots Vegapunk has seem to be based
on the giant one Luffy has just found.

00:12:41.130 --> 00:12:48.140
In other words, all the crazy stuff vegapunk
has built is just a fraction of what used

00:12:48.140 --> 00:12:49.160
to exist before.

00:12:49.160 --> 00:12:54.279
It is also no surprise then, that the government
wants to take him out.

00:12:54.279 --> 00:13:00.089
It seems like he might know more about the
true history and its power than almost anyone

00:13:00.089 --> 00:13:04.370
else, making him the number one threat to
the government.

00:13:04.370 --> 00:13:12.110
Rightfully so it seems, as one of the 6 Vegapunks,
shaka, is in contact with Dragon of the revolutionary

00:13:12.110 --> 00:13:13.110
army.

00:13:13.110 --> 00:13:17.010
By the way if you are a bit confused by the
entire 6 Vegapunk thing, how it works and

00:13:17.010 --> 00:13:21.639
what each of them is like, I did a breakdown
of them in this video right here, that you

00:13:21.639 --> 00:13:23.029
can watch next.

